A 3341 @ Undercity, 74.0, 33.3 | Andrew Brownell in the Magic Quarter. Kill Amnennar the Coldbringer, the last boss. Needs level 37.
RUN | The entrance is at the southern tip of the Barrens, just east of the Great Lift down to Thousand Needles. Fly to Camp Taurajo or Freewind Post and ride. Myriam Moonsinger at the entrance gives A Host of Evil (the enemies it asks for are outside the portal); hand it back to her after the run. Inside: Belnistrasz gives a short quest and then an escort to the idol; Ambassador Malcin (outside the portal) can drop a Small Scroll that starts a quest for Varimathras in Undercity.
T 3341 @ Undercity, 74.0, 33.3
T 6522 @ Undercity, 56.3, 92.2 | An Unholy Alliance, if you found the Small Scroll.
